# Optional, and DEV-ONLY: this file is read from the path baked in at compile time
# (`CARGO_MANIFEST_DIR`), so it only has any effect when you run or build the app from
# this checkout — it does nothing in an installed/shipped build.
#
# Players should instead use the in-app field: Settings → Spotify Client ID. That value
# is stored per machine and is read before this file (see `resolve_spotify_client_id`).
#
# Get a Client ID from https://developer.spotify.com/dashboard → Create app.
# Redirect URI must match exactly: http://127.0.0.1:8888/callback
# Development mode: add your Spotify account email under App → Settings → User Management.

# SPOTIFY_CLIENT_ID=
